                  "variants": [
                    {
                      "identifier": "f8ee1b73-6886-4878-8b77-c204106601c3",
                      "properties": {
                        "content": "<p>This page lists every cookie Kentico Community (community.kentico.com) sets, and why. Some analytics cookies are shared with other Kentico websites on kentico.com. Kentico Software s.r.o. is responsible for them. For how we use personal data, see <a href=\"~/privacy\">Privacy</a>. Last updated: 2026-11-10</p>"
                      },
                      "fieldIdentifiers": {
                        "content": "6a5096d6-eefb-4ea1-b57c-23b1b70d5d28"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "identifier": "6ed47852-0d02-49cd-81c5-251ba7d131a8",
                  "type": "CommunityPortal.CookiePreferences",
                  "variants": [
                    {
                      "identifier": "d2fb916b-9585-4dcc-8fad-3a0e15cf0954",
                      "properties": {
                        "heading": "Cookie settings",
                        "intro": "Choose which optional cookies and tracking you allow. Necessary cookies are always on because the site can't work without them. Your choice is saved in this browser. If you clear your cookies, sign out, or use another browser or device, we'll ask again.",
                        "necessaryDescription": "These cookies are essential in order to enable you to move around the website and use its features. Without these cookies, some core site functionality will not work properly.",
                        "analyticsDescription": "Google Analytics measures how the site is used (pages viewed, time on site, device and browser type, approximate location from your IP address). Kentico uses it in aggregate to improve Kentico Community and its other kentico.com websites, including how visitors move between them. Google processes this data on our behalf.",
                        "memberNote": "Your choice doesn't affect your account. All member features work with necessary cookies only.",
                        "signOutNote": "When you sign out, we reset this browser to necessary cookies only and forget your choice, so the next person using this browser starts fresh.",
                        "id": "cffc4fd4-1518-4879-8954-544beecd3504"
                      },
                      "fieldIdentifiers": {
                        "necessaryDescription": "a2cfdd83-6f20-4168-8425-350ffa549c8d",
                        "signOutNote": "b1bd7fc6-d1c8-410b-9621-5fd6e8034446",
                        "memberNote": "bf37a538-9adc-41e4-9d08-88fc8a2c6153",
                        "analyticsDescription": "cc949880-61c3-4a3d-9aa3-d3d9b4b65a5f",
                        "intro": "c080e6f6-8057-4e1f-90ae-4f491f51a272",
                        "heading": "91ce17f3-c9a5-480e-b2fa-98b16f45f352",
                        "id": "7059b214-2316-4cae-8627-5a25bcff30eb"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "identifier": "8035cefb-77be-4d70-bf70-eca0d57df9c0",
                  "type": "Kentico.Widget.RichText",
                  "variants": [
                    {
                      "identifier": "cfd348a9-d8bd-4eb0-a791-f5f60d17a5be",
                      "properties": {
                        "content": "<h2 class=\"h2 mt-5\" id=\"cookies\">Cookies we use</h2><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-striped table-bordered\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Cookie</th><th scope=\"col\">Provider</th><th scope=\"col\">Purpose</th><th scope=\"col\">Category</th><th scope=\"col\">Xperience cookie level</th><th scope=\"col\">Expires</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>CMSCookieLevel</code></td><td>Kentico Community</td><td>Stores your cookie choice for the site platform</td><td>Necessary</td><td>System</td><td>1 year</td></tr><tr><td><code>kcp.cookieconsent</code></td><td>Kentico Community</td><td>Stores your banner and settings choice (version, analytics, tracking)</td><td>Necessary</td><td>System</td><td>1 year</td></tr><tr><td><code>kcp.notification-cleared</code></td><td>Kentico Community</td><td>Remembers site alerts you dismissed</td><td>Necessary</td><td>Essential</td><td>Days</td></tr><tr><td><code>.AspNetCore.Identity.Application</code></td><td>Kentico Community</td><td>Keeps you signed in</td><td>Necessary</td><td>n/a (framework)</td><td>14 days, renewed while active</td></tr><tr><td><code>.AspNetCore.Antiforgery.*</code></td><td>Kentico Community</td><td>Protects forms from cross-site request forgery</td><td>Necessary</td><td>n/a (framework)</td><td>Session</td></tr><tr><td><code>__cf_bm</code></td><td>Cloudflare (on our domain)</td><td>Bot protection</td><td>Necessary</td><td>n/a</td><td>30 minutes</td></tr><tr><td><code>_GRECAPTCHA</code></td><td>Google (google.com)</td><td>Spam and abuse protection. Only on registration and forms with spam protection.</td><td>Necessary</td><td>n/a</td><td>6 months</td></tr><tr><td><code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_X720WCX590</code>, <code>_ga_42M5EMV0PB</code>, <code>_ga_BVZVC8F2R5</code></td><td>Google Analytics (.kentico.com, shared with other Kentico websites)</td><td>Distinguish visitors and sessions for usage statistics across Kentico websites</td><td>Analytics (consent)</td><td>n/a (Google consent mode)</td><td>Up to 2 years</td></tr><tr><td><code>CurrentContact</code></td><td>Kentico Community</td><td>Links your visits to your visitor record for website tracking and personalization</td><td>Website tracking (consent)</td><td>Visitor</td><td>Up to 400 days (browser limit)</td></tr><tr><td><code>CMSLandingPageLoaded</code></td><td>Kentico Community</td><td>Records the first page of your visit</td><td>Website tracking (consent)</td><td>Visitor</td><td>20 minutes</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Kentico staff who edit the site get additional cookies that are needed to use the administration.</p><h2 class=\"h2 mt-5\" id=\"email-statistics\">Email statistics</h2><p>Kentico Community emails don't set cookies, but every email includes a small tracking image and links that pass through our site. We record whether and when each email was opened and which links were clicked, linked to the email sent to you, to measure and improve our emails. This happens for every email, whatever you choose here. We keep copies of sent emails for 14 days. The statistics themselves don't include your email address or a contact ID, so after those 14 days they can't be linked to you. If you allow website tracking, your opens and clicks are also linked to your visitor record. See <a href=\"~/privacy#email-statistics\">Privacy</a>.</p><h2 class=\"h2 mt-5\" id=\"changing-your-choice\">Changing your choice</h2><p>Use the <a href=\"#cookie-settings\">Cookie settings</a> above at any time. Choosing \"Necessary only\" deletes the analytics and tracking cookies we set in this browser.</p><p>If you turn Analytics off, Kentico Community stops sending analytics data. Analytics cookies shared with other Kentico websites aren't deleted, because those sites use them under their own cookie settings. You can delete them in your browser.</p><p><strong>No advertising.</strong> Kentico Community doesn't use advertising or remarketing cookies.</p>"
                      },
                      "fieldIdentifiers": {
                        "content": "664f74ee-e5e9-4b6d-a98e-ec7ff5b534de"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
